        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Peter Breck, Ruta Lee\n- Works: Hootenanny Hoot, Seven Brides for Seven Brothers, Abilene\n- Roles: actress, dancer\n- Topics: chart performance\n\nFacts:\n- Ruta Lee was born on May 30, 1935.\n- Ruta Lee is a Canadian actress and dancer.\n- Ruta Lee appeared as one of the brides in the musical Seven Brides for Seven Brothers.\n- Hootenanny Hoot stars Peter Breck and Ruta Lee.\n- The song Abilene reached number one on the U.S. country music chart for four weeks.\n- The song Abilene peaked at number 15 on the pop music charts.",
